# ========================================
# Whitelist mode: ignore everything first
# ========================================
*

# ========================================
# Whitelist: source code
# ========================================
!src/
!src/**

# ========================================
# Whitelist: CI & docs
# （白名单模式下漏一项，CI/文档就会被静默排除在仓库外 —— 见 docs/adr/0001）
# ========================================
!.github/
!.github/**
!docs/
!docs/**

# ========================================
# Whitelist: build & config
# ========================================
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!esbuild.js
!.gitignore

# ========================================
# Whitelist: documentation
# ========================================
!README.md
!README_EN.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!LICENSE

# ========================================
# Whitelist: scripts & tests
# ========================================
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!test/
!test/**

# ========================================
# Whitelist: assets
# ========================================
!icon.png
!.vscodeignore

# ========================================
# 有意排除（不是遗漏）：
# - wasm/**     16MB 语言语法二进制，改由 postinstall 按 SHA-256 校验下载，见 docs/adr/0002
# - dist/**     esbuild 产物
# - ARCHITECTURE.md  本地草稿
# ========================================
ARCHITECTURE.md
